 routing biomass to fine_detritus is rejected. While the observation is technically accurate, the codebase already comprehensively documents this as intentional current behavior (ROUTING.md:144), lists it as known design debt (scientific_inventory.md:226), and has a fully-specified backlog item (tanksim-6e5.3.5) to split the action into TrimPlantsAndExport vs TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings. The implementation, documentation, and backlog are aligned — this is not a new finding requiring action."},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"05affa9a-46f2-46f5-889c-baf2ce28e117"}
